    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "go Yahwe",
      "rationale": "Sebotšišo se sebotša Yahwe ka tlwaelo — pele phetolelo ya sebotšišo e sepela go setšhaba ka bophara."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "אתננו — mo",
      "rationale": "Seheberu se šumiša botee ('ke tla mo fa') go bolela mohlapa wa Binjamine ka moka; diphetholelo tše dingwe di ngwala 'ba' ka bontši."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "a be",
      "rationale": "Seheberu se se na kopula pele ga עֹמֵד; Sepedi e e nyaka."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme Pinekhase, mora Elazara, mora Aharone, a be a eme pele ga yona matsatsing ao, a re: Na nka oketša gape go tšwa go lwantšhana le bana ba Binjamine, mothaladi wa ka, goba nka ema? Gomme Yahwe a re: Namelang, ka gobane ka moso ke tla mo fa seatleng sa gago.",
